WEBVTT

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:19.170
Madagasc, centuries, the bloodiest cockpit of all the seas,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.920
where the infamous Brotherhood of the Damned

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.420
waited to plunder the treasure-laden galleons from India and Cathay,

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.980
then returned drunk with slaughter to their pirate stronghold of land.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.080
Most ruthless of all was Captain William Kidd.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:39.650
He encountered the great London galleon, the Twelve Apostles, commanded by Admiral Lord Blaine.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:48.100
And approaching unsuspected in the guise of a peaceful merchant, by a sudden treacherous salvo, he reduced her to a burning hulk.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:56.420
When night fell, the Twelve Apostles was only a blazing funeral pyre on the placid surface of a Madagascar lagoon.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.020
Tap me!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.240
There's a pretty sight.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:04.610
